  "body_html": "<p>Bring the thrilling spirit of the game straight to your bedroom with this custom sports-themed bedding set from Jeminise. Great for football lovers, players, and fans alike, this bedding provides a super soft feel and a layer of breathable warmth, making it the perfect personal addition or a thoughtful gift for any occasion.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with options for custom text inputs, allowing you to add a name and jersey number for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Two Bedding Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover designed to be paired with an insert, or a cozy, thicker comforter that provides all-in-one warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for any bedroom setup, available in Twin, Full, Queen, and King sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, quick-drying, and simple to maintain for long-lasting durability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Amazing Football Squad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
